(alarm-multiple) begin
(alarm-multiple) Creating 5 threads to sleep 7 times each.
(alarm-multiple) thread 0: duration=10, iteration=1, product=10
(alarm-multiple) thread 1: duration=20, iteration=1, product=20
(alarm-multiple) thread 0: duration=10, iteration=2, product=20
...
(alarm-multiple) thread 4: duration=50, iteration=7, product=350
(alarm-multiple) end
Execution of 'alarm-multiple' complete.
Timer: 583 ticks
Thread: 550 idle ticks, 33 kernel ticks, 0 user ticks

Antes da correcao (timer_sleep com busy wait): 0 idle ticks, 581 kernel ticks
Depois (timer_sleep sem busy wait): 550 idle ticks, 33 kernel ticks
=> CPU fica ociosa em vez de girar em busy wait enquanto as threads dormem.

